Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.21,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is a paradise.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:31.76,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will be able to save it with our hands
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.38,0:00:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be able to save our lives.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.39,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be able to save our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be able to save our lives.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.02,0:01:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the power of your focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody did the icy river, but\NGoma-mon fished him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe nursed Cody back to health,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.78,0:01:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but his cure didn't include being\Nattacked by Ebidramon and Chuumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Armored Digimon destroyed the Control\NSpire, and Ikkakumon saved the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope the next Control Spire\Nis somewhere a little warmer.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.60,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx125\fscy125\pos(317,323)}A Dangerous Picnic
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention passengers, East meets West\NAirlines welcomes you to Tokyo. Again,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we We apologize for the pilot's stepping\Nout for popcorn during the in-flight movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will the owner of the\NGray 747 parked outside
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.82,0:02:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the window please report to the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your lights are on. Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so bright out and I'm wide awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,8.54 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still on New York time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better change my watch. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm caught up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.98,0:02:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis! Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis! Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis! Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning. Sleep well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, until I heard all that screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time I tell you to wake me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,try to be a little quieter\Nso I can get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I turn my back on him for\None minute and he disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upamon, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Upamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell\Nyou not to wander around the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom might think you're a rodent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.43,0:03:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think your mom is making\Nus some candy over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not candy, it's sushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it taste like candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's seaweed and raw fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:03:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was my first reaction, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made a nice little\Nbed for you, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm getting in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think again. Oh, come on. Be a sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.26,0:04:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gym socks from yesterday are in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mom, I think I'm packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides the usual, I'm also taking\Npotato salad, macaroni salad,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tuna salad, chicken salad, fruit\Nsalad, and three bean salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's only two bean salad today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was out of the third\Nbean that's an awful lot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of food for one girl to\Nhave for lunch I told
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you I'm having a picnic\Nwith the computer club
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,today so I offered to\Nbring salad for everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who's paying for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I need to talk to you about that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.38,0:04:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli wait
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:05:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry, open up, open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Poromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sitting on this cool slough\Nis getting a little messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's in here that\Nhas such a foul smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deviled eggs! Pee-ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poromon's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can smell them from\Nall the way over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the mayonnaise has gone bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't the others supposed to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what took you guys so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stopped at a drinking\Nfountain to give Poromon a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.98,0:05:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now everybody remember my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.26,0:05:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep crouching!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I know it's a Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not really supposed to be at school,\Nbut nobody is within miles of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to crouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, Davis, I don't think it's\Nreally necessary for me to crouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I the best or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:05:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I wonder if the Digital\NWorld is open on Saturdays?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I got a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I the best or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.22,0:06:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but are you\Nsupposed to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, T.K., Kari. Yep, yep,\NDavis, Yoli, Cody. I want you to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.06,0:06:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meet someone this is our\Nfriend mimi she's one of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the original digi destined\Nto move to america i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mimi i've set my sights\Non success in the fashion
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world of new york city\Ndon't think i'm just a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strawberry blonde beauty\Nwho knows she's beautiful hi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.22,0:06:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mimi sora told us all about\Nyou i spoke to her she
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,told me about you too\Nhello mimi My name's Davis,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you can call me Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she definitely told me about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got him on, Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:06:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:07:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other than being stuffed in a\Nknapsack like a wet towel, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was passing by the school and just\Nhad to take a look for old time's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just walked in the front gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone left it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.92,0:07:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had to sneak in since\Nthe school was closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all decided to go on a nice\NSaturday picnic in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Mimi can come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been there in so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it would be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, we didn't bring enough\Nsodas for an extra person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.02,0:07:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can have my soda. Mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfecto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.63,0:07:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's go! That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the rest of us don't\Nhave anything to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiport, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, good news, guys. Take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see a control\Nspire anywhere, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sirree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.56,0:08:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cool. I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digital world hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll see Palmon again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know an emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he builds these control spires,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tries to take over the digital\Nworld, yadda yadda yadda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if there's no control\Nspires, are we safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's why we picked\Nthis spot to go on our picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we never would have thought about\Nhaving a picnic here in the old days,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because we'd be too worried\Nabout giant-sized digital ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.18,0:08:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So far, every time we've come here,\Nit's been to destroy a control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.72,0:08:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but since it's Saturday, we thought\Nwe'd just come here to have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should pick out a\Nspot around here to lay
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out the picnic blanket and dish out\Nthe food. Sounds great. No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.92,0:08:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way too early for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:09:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a little hungry. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starved. Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought these from my\Nfamily's convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.42,0:09:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A chocolate-covered rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't had one since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.80,0:09:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'll you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have whatever Armadimon is having.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.00,0:09:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's eating sushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.98,0:09:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have one sushi, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, never throw food. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut back, Little Sushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Hawkmon, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a California roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, it's rolling all\Nthe way back to California.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like that they're going\Noff into the woods all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:09:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope she's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing that I remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fell. We all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.28,0:10:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means the Digimon\NEmperor controls this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something tells me those aren't\Ntail lights in a parking lot
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,princess mimi princess\Nrelax they're just Gekomon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:11:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Otamamon how do you know that mimi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because they're my friends\Nthey don't look too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not while they're\Nwearing those dark rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.10,0:11:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.94,0:11:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, gosh, Mimi, if those are your\Nfriends, I'd hate to see your enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.72,0:11:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish Palmon was here to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison Ivy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:12:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh! Palmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you needed a vine
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.22,0:12:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.92,0:12:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.41,0:12:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see you! I'm happy\Ntoo! I've never been this happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.30,0:12:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my whole life I've never known\Nwhat happiness was until today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get any happier, I'll start to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm caught in your vines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm caught in your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.81,0:12:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.38,0:12:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough reminiscing, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This area is called the Night Forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the Digimon Emperor has taken control\Nof all the Gekomon and the Otamamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:12:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:13:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to destroy the Control Spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been living in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compared to getting a taxi,\Nthat should be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't destroy the tower alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better contact the others\Nand let them know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, Yoli, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, Yoli, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place has some echo. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get through to\NDavis, but so far, no luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's from Yoli, but the\Nsignal's kind of weak She must be nearby
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in what direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon Emperor must be\Nblocking the signal Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful way to\Nspend a relaxing weekend
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting rid of unwanted weeds in my garden
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormont, yes, master\NWho's the Digimon du jour?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Roachmon brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.97,0:13:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Summon them immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're staying at the Roachmon Motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't even hear the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hope we're not bugging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roachmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Roachmon brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Roachmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm his twin brother, Roachmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I use my garbage dump\Nattack to trash my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I throw my yard sale bombs to wipe\Nout my opponents and clean out my garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you said there\Nwas a bunch of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.42,0:14:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sue me, I heard wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.96,0:14:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really that hard\Nto write down a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.26,0:14:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time you take the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but do you always argue?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gokimon Brothers don't\Nargue, now stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I should use my garbage\Ndump attack to finish them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just use my yard sale bombs on\Nthem and we won't even have to bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.78,0:14:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better yet, how about neither?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Roachmon brothers are\Nnot going to tell you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:14:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.32,0:14:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea, Roachmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.06,0:15:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's use both attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mojyamon, that's the first\Nsmart thing you've said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garbage dump!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a designer blouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't play.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sail bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon Digibomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't until the control\Nspire is destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they were 10 feet away and\Nyou missed them i missed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you missed boy that's for\Nbrothers they sure don't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:15:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get along very well i'd\Nbe best friends with my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sister if she was someone\Nlike mimi oh mimi you're my
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beautiful sister yoli\Nyou're beautiful too and we
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,live in a beautiful house\Nwith a beautiful garden life
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.26,0:16:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is beautiful yoli i don't\Nmean to interrupt your
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,daydream but this This is a\Nrather precarious situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.44,0:16:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.52,0:16:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, I'm a Digivolve tool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters!\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holsmon, the wings of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:17:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave, climb on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.14,0:17:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that olmer digivolving\Nis so fashionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dempsey Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like someone\Njust set off a bug bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind, there's two of\Nus, and only one of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roachmon flyswatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.66,0:17:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, they come again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.94,0:17:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raremon, exterminate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those Roachmon don't seem to be too smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can use them to destroy the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, perfecto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.86,0:17:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Palmon, let's get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.58,0:17:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.52,0:17:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roachmon, exterminate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since these guys aren't too bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now? Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the Chosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.86,0:18:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would it evolve, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needle spray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.86,0:18:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they've destroyed another one of my\Ncontrol spires talk about a wasted weekend
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.90,0:19:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm going home lock up\Nwhen you're done about
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.44,0:19:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time now i can watch my saturday cartoons
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey look it's yoli's signal it's coming in
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crystal clear that's a\Ngood sign it must mean
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that they're all okay\Nand they were able to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destroy the control spire\Nin that area All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.82,0:19:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way to go, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.58,0:19:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now they'll be friendly. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last thing I remember,\Nwe were at the motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we were out by the\Npool and you took my towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you ate the little\Nchocolate they put on the pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I put those chocolates on the pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.00,0:19:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought them from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.26,0:19:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those were my chocolates in the freezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's my freezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm paying rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just goes to show you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are some families where they're\Nbetter off having only one child.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Yoli,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.22,0:19:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in some cases like this one,\Nthey shouldn't have kids at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.18,0:19:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's time we left these two alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.32,0:19:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, stay on\Nyour half of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:19:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you stay on yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.98,0:20:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes Davis and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.68,0:20:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, we're over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They told us you were back,\Nprincess, but we didn't believe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Mimi, we've been waiting for\Nthe day that you would return to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Tokomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will protect this area now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.72,0:20:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always counted on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Mimi's Digimon, Tokomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.51,0:20:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, call us if you need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rubbing my eyes hurts too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're half of the sky, too. Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for a great picnic. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mimi, I almost forgot. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to say, when I get\Nolder, I want to be just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.28,0:21:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfecto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A-N-D-E-R-I-D-E-R-I-S-A-N-J-I-I-R-I-I-E-G-O-I-R.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,World. It's almost like a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like a feeling of the air.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of the.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.62,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.86,0:21:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world. I'm in the middle of the.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.62,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:22:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Door.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.25,0:22:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.52,0:22:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,middle of the
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wind I'll be in the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be in the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.38,0:22:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'll be in the next day.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous life!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.98,0:22:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be in the next day!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.23,0:23:04.27,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fscx125\fscy125\pos(316,327)}Hikari's Memories
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.32,0:23:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gateway. Thank you.

